      "extract": "arXiv:2104.06067v1 [math.QA] 13 Apr 2021 ON IRREDUCIBLE CHARACTERS OF THE IWAHORI-HECKE ALGEBRA IN TYPE A NAIHUAN JING AND NING LIU Abstract. We use vertex operators to compute irreducible characters of the Iwahori-Hecke algebra of type A. Two general formulas are given for the irreducible characters in terms of those of the symmetric groups or the Iwahori-Hecke algebras in lower degrees. Explicit formulas are",
      "extractCut": true,
