      "extract": "Let $\\mathbb{C}(q)$ be the field of rational functions in the variable $q$. The Iwahori-Hecke algebra $H_{n}(q)$ is the unital associative algebra over $\\mathbb{C}(q)$ generated by generators $T_{1}, T_{2},\\ldots, T_{n-1}$ subject to the relations $$\\begin{aligned} \\label{e:Hecke1} T_{i}T_{j}&=T_{j}T_{i}, ~~~~\\text{if}~ |i-j|>1,\\\\ \\label{e:Hecke2} T_{i}T_{i+1}T_{i}&=T_{i+1}T_{i}T_{i+1},\\\\ \\label{e:Hecke3}",
      "extractCut": true
    },
